    "typography_notes": "Sans-serif (Arial/Helvetica-like) for title/labels; math in serif-italic (Times/Cambria Math-like). Title largest, bold, centered, dark red ~22 pt. Subtitle italic underlined, smaller, left-aligned, red. Equations/body left-aligned inside panels; annotations 'Coefficient of ...' roman; body equation lines about 13-14 pt. Badge '4' small bold dark centered.",
