gle, fill #FFF2CC [?], border #BFBFBF [?].\n15. Inside the Convert note, add header 'Convert' in red #C00000, bold, underlined.\n16. Inside the Convert note, add line 'x\u2081 \u2265 z\u2081 , x\u2082 \u2265 z\u2082 , x\u2083 \u2265 z\u2083'.\n17. Inside the Convert note, add text 'to'.\n18. Inside the Convert note, add line '\u2212x\u2081 \u2264 \u2212z\u2081 , \u2212x\u2082 \u2264 \u2212z\u2082 , \u2212x\u2083 \u2264 \u2212z\u2083'.\n19. Draw row 3 container rectangle at [0.075,0.589,0.900,0.913] with 1 px border #C00000 and no fill.\n20. Inside row 3, place left label '6 constraints, 3 variables' in red #C00000, bold ~14 pt, italic, underlined.\n21. Inside row 3, place constraint line 'y\u2081 \u2264 x\u2081 \u2264 z\u2081 , y\u2082 \u2264 x\u2082 \u2264 z\u2082 , y\u2083 \u2264 x\u2083 \u2264 z\u2083' with y in #00B050, x in #FF0000, z in #0070C0, ~14 pt.\n22. Inside row 3, place green right arrow '\u21d2' at [0.433,0.700,0.466,0.742], color #00B050.\n23. Inside row 3, place matrix equation '[[\u22121,0,0],[0,\u22121,0],[0,0,\u22121],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0,0,1]] \u00b7 [x\u2081,x\u2082,x\u2083] \u2264 [\u2212y\u2081,\u2212y\u2082,\u2212y\u2083,z\u2081,z\u2082,z\u2083]' in box [0.475,0.595,0.75,0.895]; numerals in #000000, x-vector in #FF0000, \u2212y-vector in #00B050, z-vector in #0070C0, ~14 pt.\n24. Inside row 3, place tag '6 x 3' at [0.558,0.862,0.600,0.898], dark ink, ~9 pt.\n25. Inside row 3, place pill at [0.754,0.697,0.859,0.772]: rounded rectangle, fill #FCE4D6, text 'G x \u2264 h' centered, bold ~16 pt, color #C00000.",
