    "recreation_brief": "1. Set slide background to #FFFFFF on a 960x540 canvas.\n2. Draw outer frame rectangle at [0.057, 0.081, 0.943, 0.965] with border #C00000 and fill #FFFFFF.\n3. Place title text 'Equal Constraints' centered in region [0.397, 0.113, 0.638, 0.169], bold, color #C00000, ~30 pt.\n4. Draw yellow circle badge at [0.889, 0.102, 0.930, 0.185], fill #FFFF00, outline #000000, containing numeral '7' in black ~14 pt.\n5. Draw panel 1 rectangle at [0.094, 0.194, 0.876, 0.391] with border #C00000 and fill #FFFFFF.\n6. Inside panel 1 left zone [0.103, 0.207, 0.640, 0.382], place stacked equation '\u2211_{i=1}^{3} a_i x_i = a_1x_1 + a_2x_2 + a_3x_3 = Z' with a-series in #0000FF, x-column in #FF0000, tall parentheses, black operators.\n7. Inside panel 1, place magenta right arrow '\u21d2' at [0.410, 0.285, 0.455, 0.325], color #FF00FF.\n8. Inside panel 1 center, place equation '(a_1 a_2 a_3)(x_1; x_2; x_3) = (Z)_{1*1}' with a-series #0000FF, x-column #FF0000, tall parentheses.\n9. Inside panel 1 right side, place label 'One Constraint' in #0000FF, underlined, ~15-16 pt, above text 'Ax=b' in ~18 pt bold with A and b in #FF0000 and x in #0000FF [?].\n10. Draw panel 2 rectangle at [0.094, 0.415, 0.876, 0.696] with border #C00000 and fill #FFFFFF.\n11. Inside panel 2 left zone [0.103, 0.426, 0.540, 0.685], place three stacked equations: '\u2211_{i=1}^{3} a_i x_i = Z_1' (a-series #0000FF), '\u2211_{i=1}^{3} b_i x_i = Z_2' (b-series #FF00FF), '\u2211_{i=1}^{3} c_i x_i = Z_3' (c-series #00B000), all with x-column #FF0000.\n12. Inside panel 2, place magenta right arrow '\u21d2' at [0.260, 0.530, 0.300, 0.580], color #FF00FF.\n13. Inside panel 2 center, place matrix equation '[a_1 a_2 a_3; b_1 b_2 b_3; c_1 c_2 c_3](x_1; x_2; x_3) = (Z_1; Z_2; Z_3)_{3*1}' with row colors #0000FF, #FF00FF, #00B000, x-column #FF0000, tall parentheses, subscript '3*1'.\n14. Inside panel 2 right side, place label 'Three Constraints' in #0000FF, underlined, ~15-16 pt, above text 'Ax=b' in ~18 pt bold with A and b in #FF0000 and x in #0000FF [?].\n15. Draw panel 3 rectangle at [0.094, 0.720, 0.876, 0.943] with border #C00000 and fill #FFFFFF.\n16. Inside panel 3 left zone [0.103, 0.730, 0.550, 0.928], place four linear equations: 'x_1 + 2x_2 = 7', '3x_1 + 4x_2 = 12', '3x_3 - 5x_1 = 10', 'x_1 + x_2 + x_3 = 24' in black with x-column #FF0000.\n17. Inside panel 3, place magenta right arrow '\u21d2' at [0.270, 0.815, 0.305, 0.855], color #FF00FF.\n18. Inside panel 3 center, place matrix equation '[1 2 0; 3 4 0; -5 0 3; 1 1 1]_{4*3}(x_1; x_2; x_3) = (7; 12; 10; 24)_{4*1}' in black with x-column #FF0000, tall parentheses, subscripts '4*3' and '4*1'.\n19. Inside panel 3 right side, place label 'Four Constraints' in #0000FF, underlined, ~15-16 pt, above text 'Ax=b' in ~18 pt bold with A and b in #FF0000 and x in #0000FF [?].\n20. Use sans-serif font (Calibri/Arial-like) throughout; math variables italic, operators upright.",
