    "typography_notes": "Title bold ~22 pt centered black. Math in serif italic math face ~12 pt; a-terms red, b-terms blue, \u03c6 black[?]; column vectors stacked; '2D \u21d2 3D' bold red; final 121s flagged by red left arrows.",
